{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EMBARK ON YOUR OWN JOURNEY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your own team and go from championship to championship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the eye of a supplier and become a factory team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your team by developing your campus, hiring talented drivers and designers and getting better sponsor deals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire the best designers right away or try to develop their skills over the seasons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your own parts or get them from a supplier.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tradeoffs will see you succeed or fail over the course of a season.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch long-term projects for a leap in performance.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ADAPT TO REGULATION CHANGES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start working on the next generation race pod in advance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure the deal you make with a supplier will not bite you back upon a new regulation change a few seasons later.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEVELOP YOUR OWN DRIVER ACADEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let new drivers gain experience in lower championships and then promote them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INVEST IN INFRASTRUCTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop your campus for better R&amp;D, performance and weather forecasting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FOCUS ON YOUR TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is more about developping your team than managing races. You will have the opportunity to adjust some strategy elements before a race but you will not micromanage it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BOTS PLAY BY THE RULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bots have to work with the same constraints as you do and do not cheat.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3026180?t=1745234799","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3026180?t=1745234799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026180/933c4140f4a350de2d735215e07b77e14ddda65c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745234799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026180/933c4140f4a350de2d735215e07b77e14ddda65c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745234799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3026270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EMBARK ON YOUR OWN JOURNEY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your own team and go from championship to championship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the eye of a supplier and become a factory team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your team by developing your campus, hiring talented drivers and designers and getting better sponsor deals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire the best designers right away or try to develop their skills over the seasons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your own parts or get them from a supplier.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tradeoffs will see you succeed or fail over the course of a season.</p>